<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CEN BANK SETS O/N REPO, LIMIT RATE 15.2 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CEN BANK SETS O/N REPO, LIMIT RATE 15.2 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) set an overnight repo tender on Friday to add liquidity with a limit rate of 15.2 percent.</p>
<p>At the last overnight repo, on July 18, the limit rate was set at 16.3 percent.</p>
<p>Up to two bids will be accepted in the Amercian style operation at a minimum of 100 million crowns each.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
